      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.74 (up from ₹6.16 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.15b (up 28% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹76.2m (up 58% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.6% (up from 5.4% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 31% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 1% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
